    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, I haven't really refined the art of Slot Addition.",
      "translation" : "嗯，我還沒有完全掌握新增插槽的技術。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's so complicated that I'd be lying if I told you that I knew every factor that affected the process.",
      "translation" : "這個過程太複雜了，要是說我知道影響成功率的所有因素，那就是在撒謊。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 221,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Still, I do notice a few trends...",
      "translation" : "不過，我確實發現了一些規律..."
    },
