      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Again, ^FF0000only carry one of the equipment to which you want me to add a Slot^000000.",
      "translation" : "再說一次，^FF0000只帶一件你想讓我新增插槽的裝備^000000。"
    },
